        {
          "es": "La última vez, Pele y Kamapuaʻa pelearon con fuego y lluvia, y se repartieron la isla.",
          "en": "Last time, Pele and Kamapuaʻa fought with fire and rain, and divided the island between them."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero Pele tenía otra rival, más callada y más fría.",
          "en": "But Pele had another rival, quieter and colder."
        },
        {
          "es": "Al norte de Kīlauea se levanta Mauna Kea, la Montaña Blanca.",
          "en": "North of Kīlauea rises Mauna Kea, the White Mountain."
        },
        {
          "es": "En invierno, su cumbre se cubre de nieve, aunque esté en el medio del mar tropical.",
          "en": "In winter, its summit is covered with snow, even though it stands in the middle of a tropical sea."
        }
