        {
          "es": "Westervelt cuenta que así se formó la punta rocosa de Laupāhoehoe, y el arco de piedra de Onomea.",
          "en": "Westervelt tells that this is how the rocky point of Laupāhoehoe was formed, and the stone arch of Onomea."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y las rocas afiladas de esa costa son los restos de aquella batalla.",
          "en": "And the sharp rocks along that coast are what is left of that battle."
        },
        {
          "es": "Mientras tanto, arriba, la cumbre quedó blanca y en silencio.",
          "en": "Meanwhile, up above, the summit lay white and silent."
